<title>USA: Watson unit says court denies injunction.</title>
<headline>Watson unit says court denies injunction.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somerset Pharmaceuticals Inc, which is 50 percent owned by both Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc and Mylan Laboratories Inc, said Wednesday that the court denied its motion for a preliminary injunction in its lawsuit against the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
</text>
